  "whatsapp_greeting": "Hi! \ud83d\udc4b I'm ISLA from ISLA Accounting Corp.\n\nI'll be helping you set up your account with one of our accountant experts, making the process smooth for both you and our team.\n\nTo get started, are you reaching out as:\n\n1\ufe0f\u20e3 Individual/Personal client\n2\ufe0f\u20e3 Business/Entity client\n\nJust reply with 1 or 2, or let me know! \ud83d\ude0a"
